Z||000005||WampusCat||11-21-2001||04:49 PM||||"A versatile seating package allows the Sky to convert easily from two-place to four-place seating. The extra seats in the rear stow away underneath the tonneau cover when not in use. <BR>  The Saturn Sky also provides easy entry and exit. On this concept, Saturn continues with a unique feature to the brand — a rear access door on the driver's side. This application is borrowed from today's Saturn coupe, the only vehicle in the market that has this innovation." <A HREF="http://www.saturnbp.com:90/company/news_and_events/press_releases/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.saturnbp.com:90/company/news_and_events/press_releases/</A> <BR>Weird.||||reg||1
